# Submission path budget (8,388,608 bytes maximum):
# src/ + shared/ + server/ + tests/ + scripts/: 700,000 bytes
# public/ + dist/: 3,000,000 bytes; server-build/: 200,000 bytes
# manifests + lock + docs + artifacts/: 2,000,000 bytes
# Reserved headroom: 2,488,608 bytes. dist/ and server-build/ are deliverables.
# Explicitly retain deliverables even when a parent ignore excludes build/artifact folders.
!dist/
!dist/**
!server-build/
!server-build/**
!artifacts/
!artifacts/**
# Keep these exclusions last so retained output paths cannot include nested caches.
**/node_modules/
**/.vite/
**/.cache/
**/.npm/
**/coverage/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
test/scratch/
*.tsbuildinfo
